00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:20,800
Preparation of plates.

115
00:14:20,800 --> 00:14:26,080
Glass plates usually need a pre-treatment step or the gelatin coating may peel off.

116
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:32,480
You can use old holographic plates by simply giving them a 10 minute soak in neat domestic bleach solution.

117
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:35,920
And then rub off the old gelatin layer under tap water.

118
00:14:35,920 --> 00:14:41,040
After a final rinse and distilled water, no further subbing step is usually required.

119
